    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15549" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρρώστ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>illness, sickness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Flat.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				2.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				26.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				671b9
			</span></i>: pl., of <i>epidemics</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				943.6
			</span></i> (Cos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> moral <i>infirmity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Nic.</u>
				28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Stoic, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσημα</span>
			 (of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχή</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> μετ᾽
				ἀσθενείας συμβαῖνον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				3.103
			</span></i>, cf. Chrysipp.ib.<i><span class="en">
				121
			</span></i>.</div>
